WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.879
Get back, get back, get back, get back, get back.

00:00:29.879 --> 00:00:32.680
The city's rebelling against the federal government.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:37.400
Just like in Chicago, Portland PD won't keep federal agents safe either.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.080
They actually slapped them with a zoning violation for boarding up their building's windows

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.759
so Antifa can't see inside.

00:00:44.759 --> 00:00:48.360
They believe women have a right to privacy, just not ICE.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.880
An ICE facility was just shot up in Dallas.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.720
And now cartels have put bounties on their heads.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.480
They're making plans to ambush them and to kill them.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:01.639
We have specific officers and agents that have bounties that have been put out on their

00:01:01.639 --> 00:01:02.639
heads.

00:01:02.639 --> 00:01:06.680
It's been $2,000 to kidnap them, $10,000 to kill them.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:12.480
We're trying to protect the country from cartels and they're saying we're at war with Americans

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.519
and Kristi Noem should be charged with war crimes.

